# Design system

Tokens live in `src/styles/tokens.css`. Use CSS variables — do not hardcode one-off palette values in components.

## Brand

- Mark: double slash `//` (`public/brand/mark.svg`) — steel blue `#80a2bf`
- Short wordmark: `BrandWordmark` → **SF//RZA** (header/footer)
- Full logo: `BrandLogo` → SF//RZA + **LEONARDO SFORZA** subtitle (home hero)
- Letters follow `currentColor` / `--ink`; slashes stay `#80a2bf` in both themes

## Direction

- **Notion-flat:** solid surfaces, hairline borders, no gradients, no glows
- Light: `#ffffff` / `#f7f6f3` · Dark: `#191919` / `#202020` via `html[data-theme]`
- Accent: logo steel blue `#80a2bf` (not Notion UI blue)
- UI type: Inter · Letter prose (`.prose`): Source Serif 4 / Georgia
- Motion: progress bar only; no entrance stagger/rise

## Theme

- FOUC script in `BaseLayout` sets `data-theme` from `localStorage.theme` or `prefers-color-scheme`
- `ThemeToggle` in `SiteHeader` flips light ↔ dark and persists
- `meta theme-color`: `#ffffff` / `#191919`

## Composition

- Home first viewport: full brand logo + one line + CTA group only
- Flat list cards (border + hover fill), no elevated shadows
- Avoid: gradients, frosted blur headers, pill-glow buttons, generic placeholder “L” marks
